      "statement": "LLM supports exactly two backends: LLMEngine.DEFAULT wraps litellm.completion with instructor.from_litellm in MD_JSON mode for validated outputs, and LLMEngine.PYDANTIC_AI lazily imports pydantic-ai (ImportError with install hint) to build an Agent; unknown backends raise ValueError.",
